          <groundspeak:finder id="946600">Black Shark</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP246 Warspite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We drove out onto the grass in the Iron Horse Trail staging area, got out and the coords took us the last few metres right to it.  The cover is easily lifted and the cap inside can be &quot;styled&quot; to suit various photographic angles. From the nearby signs it appears that the Iron Horse Trail is a very organized affair.  What a great repurposing for the old railroad right of way!  Thanks, ofth.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
